 result←object(State Window)arg;tunits;pix;max
 result←⍬
 ⍝ 'Window' r c h w

 'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error~##.IsNum arg←##.Single arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Window'##.Error 4≠≢arg
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Window'##.Error∨/arg<0
 pix←⌊0.5+arg×4⍴tunits←⊃##.Classes._supp.MyUnits State ⍝ Convert to pixels
 max←State._pix_size ⍝ How big is the whole object we're drawing on?
 pix[1 2]⌊←max ⋄ pix[3 4]⌊←max-pix[1 2] ⍝ Constrain maximum Window size
 State.Window←pix ⍝ Remember the Window setting in pixels
 State.Window_Mask←object(State BuildMask)pix ⍝ Create a State-internal boolean array to be used for future Window & Clip masking of all other operations
 State.Clip←⍬ ⋄ State.Clip_Mask←0 0⍴0 ⍝ Throw out old clipping when Window changes
